---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🤘Hello, Party People!</h1>
			<p>
				Welcome to my official home. I'm DJ Redfern, a DJ in Southern California since 1990. I have performed many shows large and small over the last 34 years. Along with being a producer and dj of deep and funky house I have also been a multi-instrumentalist, perfoming on piano, guitar, oud, flute, trombone and bass guitar.
			</p>
			<p>
				I specialize in bringing contant creativity to the table, using devices, instruments, samples and software to bring in grooves you love with sounds you never heard before.
			</p>
			<p>The are some of the kind of events I play or have played:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Weddings and Anniverseries/li>
				<li>Boat Parties</li>
				<li>Hospice for the Dying Parties></li>
				<li>Mansion Parties</li>
				<li>Desert Parties</li>
				<li>Night Clubs</li>
			</ul>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
